---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
import packages from '../data/packages.json';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="MHU Travel Umroh 2026 | Jadwal Lengkap & Harga Terbaik" description="Travel Umroh Resmi MHU - Akreditasi A Jadwal Umroh 2026 lengkap + harga mulai 20 jutaan." />
	</head>
	<body class="font-sans text-gray-800 antialiased bg-white">
		<!-- Header / Navbar -->
		<Header />

		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="py-16 bg-[#f7f9fb] text-center px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#c15b74] mb-4 leading-tight">
					Travel Umroh Resmi & Terpercaya MHU Travel
				</h1>
				<h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6 leading-snug">
					Agen Travel Umroh Resmi Terpercaya Akreditasi A<br/>
					PT Manasik Haji Umrah
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
					Setiap langkah menuju Tanah Suci adalah panggilan suci. Di tengah kerinduan mendalam akan<br class="hidden md:block"/>
					Baitullah, MHU Travel (PT Manasik Haji Umrah) hadir sebagai mitra terpercaya Anda.<br class="hidden md:block"/>
					Dengan pengalaman lebih dari 10 tahun di bidang haji dan umrah, kami siap mewujudkan<br class="hidden md:block"/>
					perjalanan spiritual Anda menjadi kenyataan yang nyaman, aman, dan penuh makna
				</p>
				<a href="#paket" class="inline-block bg-[#c15b74] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-md font-bold text-base md:text-lg tracking-wider hover:bg-[#a0455d] transition-colors mb-10">
					<svg class="w-4 h-4 inline-block mr-2 -mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h10a2 2 0 012 2v1m2 13a2 2 0 01-2-2V7m2 13a2 2 0 002-2V9.5a2.5 2.5 0 00-2.5-2.5H15"></path></svg>
					LIHAT DETAIL PAKET UMROH LENGKAP KAMI
				</a>
				
				<div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
					<img src="https://manasikhajiumrah.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/banner-ppiu-kan-1024x171.png" alt="Sertifikasi" class="max-h-20 object-contain" onerror="this.style.display='none';">
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Pink Box Section -->
		<section class="py-12 bg-white px-4">
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-[#fdebf0] rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
				<h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#c15b74] mb-6">PT Manasik Haji Umrah (MHU Travel)</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-800 text-lg md:text-xl mb-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
					Kami Memahami Bahwa Ibadah Umroh Adalah Perjalanan Hati Yang Membutuhkan Ketenangan Dan Kepercayaan Penuh. <strong>MHU Travel</strong> Berkomitmen Untuk Menghadirkan Pengalaman Spiritual Terbaik Dengan Berbagai Keunggulan Yang Menjamin Kedamaian Perjalanan Anda
				</p>
				
				<ul class="text-left space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8 text-gray-800 text-base md:text-lg">
					<li class="flex items-start">
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
						<span>Legalitas Dan Kepercayaan Terjamin Penuh</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start">
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
						<span>Program Pembayaran Fleksibel Dan Syariah Friendly</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start">
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
						<span>Paket Lengkap Dan Pelayanan Profesional Prima</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start">
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
						<span>Harga Kompetitif Dengan Kualitas Maksimal</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start">
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
						<span>Fokus Penuh Pada Kenyamanan Dan Kepuasan Jamaah</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start">
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
						<span>Pelopor Umroh COD: Berangkat Umroh Dulu Bayar Setelah Pulang</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
				
				<p class="text-gray-800 text-lg md:text-xl mb-8 leading-relaxed">
					Bayangkan momen itu: Kaki Anda melangkah di Tanah Suci, pandangan pertama keagungan Ka'bah, air mata syukur<br class="hidden md:block"/> menetes tak terbendung. MHU Travel hadir untuk mewujudkan kerinduan mendalam itu
				</p>
				
				<a href="https://wa.me/6285956129389" class="inline-block bg-[#c15b74] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded text-base md:text-lg font-bold hover:bg-[#a0455d] transition-colors">
					WUJUDKAN IMPIAN UMROH ANDA: KONSULTASI GRATIS SEKARANG!
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Mengapa Bersama MHU Travel -->
		<section class="py-10 bg-white text-center">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
				<p class="text-[#3569b4] text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Layanan Kami</p>
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#c15b74] mb-10">Mengapa Bersama MHU Travel</h2>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Statistics Banner -->
		<section class="py-12 bg-[#fdebf0] text-center px-4 border-t border-b border-pink-100">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Alhamdulillah, ribuan jamah sudah berangkat bersama MHU.</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-medium mb-6">Visi kami memberangkatkan 1 jt jamaah pada tahun 2030, secara bertahap insya Allah tercapai</p>
				
				<div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#c15b74] mb-4">300 + Jama'ah/Bulan</div>
				<p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 mb-8">Alhamdulillah, Lebih dari 1,000 jama'ah berangkat setiap bulan. Paket umroh kami cepat habis!</p>
				
				<a href="https://wa.me/6285956129389" class="inline-block bg-[#c15b74] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded text-base md:text-lg font-bold hover:bg-[#a0455d] transition-colors">
					KONSULTASI KEBERANGKATAN GRATIS. KLIK DISINI
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Features Cards -->
		<section class="py-16 bg-white relative z-10 -mt-8 px-4">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				<div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#c15b74] p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
					<div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
						<svg class="w-16 h-16 text-[#c15b74]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xl mb-4">Legalitas dan Kepercayaan Terjamin Penuh</h4>
					<p class="text-gray-700 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
						MHU Travel resmi berizin PPIU (Penyelenggara Perjalanan Ibadah Umrah), beroperasi di bawah pengawasan ketat Kementerian Agama.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#c15b74] p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
					<div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
						<svg class="w-16 h-16 text-[#c15b74]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xl mb-4">Program Pembayaran Fleksibel & Syariah Friendly</h4>
					<p class="text-gray-700 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
						Wujudkan impian umroh Anda tanpa beban biaya di awal melalui inovasi program pembiayaan kami yang fleksibel dan Syariah friendly
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#c15b74] p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
					<div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
						<svg class="w-16 h-16 text-[#c15b74]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xl mb-4">Paket Lengkap Dan Layanan Aman Nyaman</h4>
					<p class="text-gray-700 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
						Perjalanan tanpa perlu pusing urus ini itu. Paket umroh MHU travel dirancang komprehensif, untuk keamanan dan kenyamanan ibadah anda
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- 2 Columns: Paket Info & Video -->
		<section class="py-12 bg-white px-4">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 bg-[#fdfafb] rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-12">
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#c15b74] mb-8 leading-tight">Paket Ibadah Haji & Umroh MHU travel</h3>
					<ul class="space-y-6 text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
							<div>
								<strong>Bimbingan Ibadah Yang Lengkap Dan Mendalam</strong> - Dari Muthawif Tersertifikasi
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
							<div>
								<strong>Pelayanan Profesional, Sigap, Dan Responsif</strong>
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
							<div>
								<strong>Ilmu Dan Nilai Spiritual Yang Mendalam</strong> - Yang Didapatkan Selama Perjalanan, Melampaui Sekadar Ritual
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
							<div>
								<strong>Suasana Kekeluargaan Dan Kekompakan Rombongan</strong> - Yang Menghangatkan Hati
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#c15b74] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
							<div>
								<strong>Fasilitas Dan Akomodasi Prima</strong> - Termasuk Hotel Strategis Dekat Masjidil Haram Dan Nabawi.
							</div>
						</li>
					</ul>
					
					<p class="mt-8 text-lg text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
						<svg class="w-4 h-4 inline text-[#c15b74]" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2v6zm0-8h-2V7h2v2z"></path></svg> 
						Kerinduan Anda untuk bersimpuh di Baitullah jangan hanya menjadi impian. Ini saatnya menjawab panggilanNya! Wujudkan tekad suci Anda dalam ibadah umroh penuh keberkahan bersama MHU Travel!
					</p>
					
					<a href="https://wa.me/6285956129389" class="inline-block mt-8 text-lg font-bold text-[#3569b4] underline hover:text-blue-800">
						KLIK UNTUK KONSULTASI
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="flex items-center justify-center">
					<div class="w-full rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg aspect-[9/16] max-w-sm mx-auto flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-100 group relative">
						<a href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/u2hBKzsdL-E" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block w-full h-full relative">
							<img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u2hBKzsdL-E/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Video Keberangkatan" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
							<div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors">
								<svg class="w-16 h-16 text-white opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all drop-shadow-lg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.615 3.184c-3.604-.246-11.631-.245-15.23 0-3.897.266-4.356 2.62-4.385 8.816.029 6.185.484 8.549 4.385 8.816 3.6.245 11.626.246 15.23 0 3.897-.266 4.356-2.62 4.385-8.816-.029-6.185-.484-8.549-4.385-8.816zm-10.615 12.816v-8l8 3.993-8 4.007z"/></svg>
							</div>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Jadwal Packages -->
		<section id="paket" class="py-16 bg-white px-4">
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#c15b74] mb-4 text-center md:text-left">Jadwal Umroh PT Manasik Haji Umrah</h2>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#3569b4] mb-10 text-center md:text-left">Pilihan Paket Umroh Terbaik Kami</h3>
				
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
					{packages.items.map((pkg) => (
						<div class="flex flex-col bg-white border border-gray-100 shadow-sm rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
							<div class="bg-[#c15b74] text-white text-center py-3 px-4 text-lg font-bold">
								{pkg.title}<br/>
								{pkg.subtitle}
							</div>
							<div class="flex-grow flex justify-center items-center bg-gray-50 overflow-hidden">
								<img src={pkg.image} alt={pkg.alt} class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 image-trigger" onerror={`this.onerror=null; this.src='${pkg.fallbackImage}';`} />
							</div>
						</div>
					))}
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>


		<!-- Gallery Section -->
		<section class="py-16 bg-white px-4">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-12 text-center">
				<p class="text-[#3569b4] text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Galeri Keberangkatan</p>
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#c15b74]">Momen Indah di Tanah Suci</h2>
				<p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mt-4">Ikuti perjalanan spiritual jamaah kami melalui video terbaru di YouTube.</p>
			</div>
			
			<!-- YouTube Shorts Embed Grid -->
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 justify-items-center">
				<div class="w-full max-w-[400px] aspect-[9/16] rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg group relative">
					<a href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/u2hBKzsdL-E" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block w-full h-full relative">
						<img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u2hBKzsdL-E/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Video Keberangkatan" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors">
							<svg class="w-16 h-16 text-white opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all drop-shadow-lg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.615 3.184c-3.604-.246-11.631-.245-15.23 0-3.897.266-4.356 2.62-4.385 8.816.029 6.185.484 8.549 4.385 8.816 3.6.245 11.626.246 15.23 0 3.897-.266 4.356-2.62 4.385-8.816-.029-6.185-.484-8.549-4.385-8.816zm-10.615 12.816v-8l8 3.993-8 4.007z"/></svg>
						</div>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="w-full max-w-[400px] aspect-[9/16] rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
					<iframe 
						class="w-full h-full"
						src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vrPJAC6z6Pc?rel=0" 
						title="YouTube video player" 
						frameborder="0" 
						allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
						allowfullscreen>
					</iframe>
				</div>
				<div class="w-full max-w-[400px] aspect-[9/16] rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
					<iframe 
						class="w-full h-full"
						src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VFTqXwpmHhk?rel=0" 
						title="YouTube video player" 
						frameborder="0" 
						allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
						allowfullscreen>
					</iframe>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="text-center mt-12">
				<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@mhutravel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white border-2 border-[#c15b74] text-[#c15b74] px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-bold hover:bg-[#c15b74] hover:text-white transition-colors">
					<svg class="w-6 h-6 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.615 3.184c-3.604-.246-11.631-.245-15.23 0-3.897.266-4.356 2.62-4.385 8.816.029 6.185.484 8.549 4.385 8.816 3.6.245 11.626.246 15.23 0 3.897-.266 4.356-2.62 4.385-8.816-.029-6.185-.484-8.549-4.385-8.816zm-10.615 12.816v-8l8 3.993-8 4.007z"/></svg>
					LIHAT YOUTUBE MHU TRAVEL
				</a>
			</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="bg-[#c15b74] text-white pt-16 pb-8">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-12">
					<!-- Company Info -->
					<div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
						<div class="bg-white inline-block p-3 rounded-lg mb-6">
							<img src="https://manasikhajiumrah.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/cropped-logo-1-300x86-1-1.png" alt="MHU Travel Logo" class="h-10 md:h-12 w-auto" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/150x50?text=MHU+Travel';">
						</div>
						<p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 text-pink-50">
							PT Manasik Haji Umrah (MHU Travel) adalah agen travel perjalanan ibadah Umroh dan Haji khusus yang berizin resmi (PPIU), terpercaya, dan amanah. Kami berkomitmen memberikan pelayanan terbaik demi kenyamanan ibadah Anda di Tanah Suci.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Quick Links -->
					<div>
						<h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-4 uppercase text-base tracking-wider">Tautan Cepat</h4>
						<ul class="space-y-4 text-base text-pink-100">
